                  },
                  {
                    "value": "\n• UBC CHSA 3243 is excluded by the Vancouver City overlap rule.\n• One retained facility required approximately 25 m edge tolerance.\n• No retained mapped facility has a null CHSA assignment.\n• 29 Vancouver candidate facility records lacked coordinates and may undercount mapped supply.\n• Cross-boundary services are not modeled as patient-access flows.\n• Zero mapped facilities does not prove absence of healthcare access.",
